::ENG4_U04_L02_Q01::[MLA.ENG4.RS.01] Research question: How do evening library hours affect adult learners? Source A gives attendance data, Source B gives an interview, and Source C gives staffing costs. Which synthesis is strongest?
{
=B. The sources together show demand, lived need, and feasibility for evening library hours.#Correct. This answer applies the lesson skill accurately and matches the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
~A. Source A exists, Source B exists, and Source C exists.#Incorrect. This answer does not fully match the lesson skill or it misreads the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
~C. Source B is the only useful source because it is personal.#Incorrect. This answer does not fully match the lesson skill or it misreads the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
~D. Source C proves no one needs the program.#Incorrect. This answer does not fully match the lesson skill or it misreads the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
}
